        "text": "Hashing Basics\nHashing algorithms confirm the integrity of digital data. What does this mean\nin practice? Assume that you just downloaded a file from the internet: how do\nyou make sure that the source file was not altered while it was on its way from\nthe source to the destination? In other words, you need a way to verify that\nthe source file is authentic (you will see more examples about hashing in the\nupcoming sections).\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 One-Way Hash Function\n\u2022 Hashing Scenarios\n\u2022 Hashing Algorithms\n\u2022 Message Digest 5\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
